{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.HqBiFiltration.BiFiltration","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.HqBiFiltration.BiFiltration","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":13,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.HqBiFiltration.BiFiltration.proj_add_fixed","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.HqBiFiltration.BiFiltration.proj_add_fixed","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/HqBiFiltration/BiFiltration.lean#L64-L69","doc":"The stratum is closed under addition (an additive subgroup of `G^(n)`\nmodulo the filtration): if `α, β` are both `e`-fixed then so is `α + β`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.HqBiFiltration.BiFiltration.mem_stratum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.HqBiFiltration.BiFiltration.mem_stratum","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/HqBiFiltration/BiFiltration.lean#L59-L62","doc":"`α` lies in some stratum iff it is in the corresponding depth level and is\n`e`-fixed. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.HqBiFiltration.BiFiltration.proj_idem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.HqBiFiltration.BiFiltration.proj_idem","kind":"theorem","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/HqBiFiltration/BiFiltration.lean#L53-L57","doc":"The projector is idempotent: `p(p(α)) = p(α)` (from `e² = e`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.HqBiFiltration.BiFiltration.proj_mul_e","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.HqBiFiltration.BiFiltration.proj_mul_e","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/HqBiFiltration/BiFiltration.lean#L49-L51","doc":"`e` absorbs on the right of a projected element. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.HqBiFiltration.BiFiltration.e_mul_proj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.HqBiFiltration.BiFiltration.e_mul_proj","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/HqBiFiltration/BiFiltration.lean#L45-L47","doc":"`e` absorbs on the left of a projected element. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.HqBiFiltration.BiFiltration.stratum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.HqBiFiltration.BiFiltration.stratum","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/HqBiFiltration/BiFiltration.lean#L41-L43","doc":"The knot-`K`-localised depth-`n` stratum\n`H_q^{(n,K)} = { α ∈ G^(n) : e·α·e = α }`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.HqBiFiltration.BiFiltration.proj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.HqBiFiltration.BiFiltration.proj","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/HqBiFiltration/BiFiltration.lean#L38-L39","doc":"The knot-`K` projector `p(α) = e·α·e`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.HqBiFiltration.BiFiltration.G_mono","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.HqBiFiltration.BiFiltration.G_mono","kind":"theorem","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/HqBiFiltration/BiFiltration.lean#L32-L32","doc":"The filtration is monotone: `G^(n) ⊆ G^(n+1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.HqBiFiltration.BiFiltration.G","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.HqBiFiltration.BiFiltration.G","kind":"def","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/HqBiFiltration/BiFiltration.lean#L30-L30","doc":"The iterated-integral depth filtration `G^(n)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.HqBiFiltration.BiFiltration.e_idem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.HqBiFiltration.BiFiltration.e_idem","kind":"theorem","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/HqBiFiltration/BiFiltration.lean#L28-L28","doc":"`e` is idempotent. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.HqBiFiltration.BiFiltration.e","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.HqBiFiltration.BiFiltration.e","kind":"def","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/HqBiFiltration/BiFiltration.lean#L26-L26","doc":"The central primitive idempotent `e_{λ_K}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.HqBiFiltration.BiFiltration.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.HqBiFiltration.BiFiltration.mk","kind":"ctor","line":24,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/HqBiFiltration/BiFiltration.lean#L24-L24","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.HqBiFiltration.BiFiltration","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.HqBiFiltration.BiFiltration","kind":"structure","line":19,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/HqBiFiltration/BiFiltration.lean#L19-L32","doc":"Data for the bi-filtration on a ring `A`.\n\nA `definition` carrier: the idempotent `e = e_{λ_K}` (`e² = e`), and the\ndepth filtration `G : ℕ → Set A` (monotone, the horizontal Goncharov\naxis). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:hq-bi-filtration","label":"def:hq-bi-filtration","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/hq-bi-filtration.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}